{
  "title": "Daily Salawat of Shaban",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "It is recommended to say the following form of invocation of blessings upon the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) and his Household (a.s.) that is reported from Imam Ali ibn al-Husayn al-Sajjad (a.s.) (i.e. Imam Zayn al-’Abidin) each midday (zohr) in Sha’ban and at the fifteenth night of it:\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ.\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ صَلِّ عَلی مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, (please do) send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad;\nشَجَرَةٍ النُّبُوَّةِ،\nSHAJARATIN NOBUWWATE \nthe tree of Prophethood,\nوَمَوضِعِ الرِّسَالَةِ،\nWA MAW-ZE-I’R RESAALATE \nthe trustees of the (Divine) Mission,\nوَمُخْتَلَفِ الْمَلَائِكَةِ\nWA MUKHTALAFIL MALAA-EKATE \nthe frequently visited by the angels,\nوَ مَعْدِنِ الْعِلْمِ،\nWA MA’DENIL I’LME \nthe core of knowledge,\nوَ اَھْلِ بَیْتِ الْوَحْیِ.\nWA AHLE BAYTIL WAHYE \nand the Household of the Divine Revelation.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ صَلِّ عَلی مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADENIL\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nالْفُلْكِ الْجَارِیَةِ فِی اللُّجَجِ الْغامِرَةِ،\nFULKIL JAAREYATE FIL LOJAJIL GHAAMERATE\nthe sailing ships through the abysmal waves.\nیَاْمَنُ مَنْ رَكِبَهَا،\nYAAMANO MAN RAKEBAHAA\nHe who embarks on will be saved\nوَ یَغْرَقُ مَنْ تَرَكَھَا،\nWA YAGHRAQO MAN TARAKAHAL\nbut he who abandons will be drowned.\nالْمُتَقَدِّمُ لَھُمْ مارِقٌ،\nMOTAQADDEMO LAHUM MAAREQUN\nHe who precedes them will miss the Right Path\nوَ الْمُتَاَخِّرُ عَنْھُمْ زَاھِقٌ،\nWAL MOTA-AKHKHERO A’NHUM ZAA-HEQUN\nand he who misses them will lose,\nوَاللَّازِمُ لَھُمْ لَاحِقٌ.\nWAL-LAAZEMO LAHUM LAAHEQUN\nbut he who adheres to them will win.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADENIL\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nالْكَھْفِ الْحَصِیْنِ،\nKAHFIL HASEENE\nthe impregnable shelter,\nوَغِیَاثِ الْمُضْطَرِّ الْمُسْتَكِیْنِ،\nWA GHEYAASIL MUZTARRIL MUSTAKEENE\nthe succorers of the helpless, distressed ones,\nوَمَلْجَاَ الْهَارِبِیْنَ\nWA MALJA-IL HAAREBEENA\nthe haven of the fugitives,\nوَ عِصْمَةِ الْمُعْتَصِمِیْنَ.\nWA I’SMATIL MO’TASEMEENA\nand the asylum of those who seek refuge.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, (please do) send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nصَلَاةً كَثِیْرَةً تَكُوْنُ لَھُمْ رِضًا\nSALAATAN KASEERATAN TAKOONO LAHUM REZAN \nso many blessings that please them\nوَ لِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ اَدَاءً وَقَضَاءً\nWA LEHAQQE MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN ADAA-AN WA QAZAA-AN \nand settle all (our) duties towards Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nبِحَوْلٍ مِنْكَ وَ قُوَّةٍ\nBEHAWLIN MINKA WA QUWWATIN \nby Your might and power, \nیَا رَبَّ الْعالَمِیْنَ\nYAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA\nO Lord of the worlds!\nاَللّٰھُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADENIT \nO Allah, (please do) send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nالطَّیِّبِیْنَ الْاَ بْرَارِ الْاَخْیَارِ\nTAYYEBEENAL ABRAARIL AKHYAARIL\nthe pure, pious, and righteous\nالَّذِیْنَ اَوْجَبْتَ حُقُوْقَھُمْ\nLAZEENA AWJABTA HOQOOQAHUM\nwhose rights have been made incumbent upon us by You\nوَ فَرَضْتَ طَاعَتَھُمْ وَ وِلَایَتَھُمْ.\nWA FARAZTA TAA-A’TAHUM WA WELAAYATAHUM\nand the obedience to whom and whose (divinely ordained) leadership have been (also) deemed obligatory upon us by You.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah, (please do) send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَ اعْمُرْ قَلْبِیْ بِطَاعَتِكَ\nWA’MUR QALBEE BE-TAA-A’TEKA \nfill my heart with obedience to You,\nوَ لَا تُخْزِنِیْ بِمَعْصِیَتِكَ\nWA LAA TUKHZENEE BE-MA’SEYATEKA \ndo not disgrace me due to my acts of disobedience to You,\nوَارْزُقْنِیْ مُوَاسَاةَ مَنْ قَتَّرْتَ عَلَیْهِ مِنْ رِزْقِكَ\nWAR ZUQNEE MOWAASAATA MAN QATTARTA A’LAYHE MIN RIZQEKA\nand grant me the feeling of sympathy towards those whom You have decided to straighten their sustenance\nبِمَا وَسَّعْتَ عَلَیَّ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ،\nBEMAA WASSA’TA A’LAYYA MIN FAZLEKA\nfor You have blessed me with affluence in livelihood\nوَ نَشَرْتَ عَلَیَّ مِنْ عَدْلِكَ،\nWA NASHARTA A’LAYYA MIN A’DLEKA\nsince You have displayed Your justice on me\nوَ اَحْیَیْتَنِیْ تَحْتَ ظِلِّكَ\nWA AHYAYTANEE TAHTA ZILLEKA\nand bestowed life on me to live under Your shade.\nوَ ھٰذَا شَھْرُ نَبِیِّكَ سَیِّدِ رُسُلِكَ\nWA HAAZAA SHAHRO NABIYYEKA SAYYEDE ROSOLEKA\nThis is the month of Your Prophet and the Master of Your Messengers.\nشَعْبَانُ الَّذِیْ حَفَفْتَهٗ مِنْكَ بِالرَّحْمَةِ\nSHA’BAANUL LAZEE HAFAFTAHU MINKA BIR-RAHMATE\nIt is Sha`ban, which You have encompassed with Your mercy and pleasure\nوَ الرِّضْوَانِ الَّذِیْ كَانَ رَسُوْلُ اللهِ\nWAR RIZWAANIL LAZEE KAANA RASOOLUL LAAHE\nand on which the Messenger of Allah, \nصَلَّی اللهُ عَلَیْهِ وَآلِهٖ وَ سَلَّمَ\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI WA SALLAMA\npeace and blessings be upon him and his Household,\nیَدْاَبُ فِیْ صِیَامِهٖ وَ قِیَامِهٖ\nYAD-ABO FEE SEYAAMEHI WA QEYAAMEHI\nused to observe fasting painstakingly and used to spend it with acts of worship\nفِیْ لَیَالِیْهِ وَاَیَّامِهٖ\nFEE LAYAALEEHE WA AYYAAMEHI \non all of its days and nights\nبُخُوْعًا لَكَ فِیْ اِكْرَامِهٖ وَ اِعْظَامِهٖ\nBOKHOO-A’N LAKA FEE IKRAAMEHI WA E-A’ZAAMEHI \non account of Your honoring and dignifying this month,\nاِلٰی مَحَلِّ حِمَامِهٖ\nELAA MAHALLE HEMAAMEHI \nup to his death.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ فَاَعِنَّا عَلَی الْاِسْتِنَانِ بِسُنَّتِهٖ فِیْهِ،\nALLAAHUMMA FA-A-I’NNA ALAL ISTENAANE BESUNNATEHI FEEHE \nO Allah, (please do) help us follow the example of him (i.e. the Holy Prophet as regards the honoring of this month)\nوَ نَیْلِ الشَّفَاعَةِ لَدَیْهِ\nWA NAYLISH SHAFAA-A’TE LADAYHE \nand help us attain his intercession for us.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ وَ اجْعَلْهُ لِیْ شَفِیْعًا مُشَفَّعًا،\nALLAAHUMMA WAJ A’LHO LEE SHAFEE-A’N MOSHAFFA-A’N \nO Allah, (please do) decide him as my interceder (before You) whose intercession for me is acceptable\nوَ طَرِیْقًا اِلَیْكَ مَھْیَعًا\nWA TAREEQAN ELAYKA MAHYA-A’N \nand as my clear path toward You,\nوَ اجْعَلْنِیْ لَهٗ مُتَّبِعًا\nWAJ A’LNEE LAHU MUTTABE-A’N\nand make me follow him\nحَتّٰی اَلْقَاكَ یَوْمَ الْقِیَامَةِ عَنِّیْ رَاضِیًا،\nHATTAA ALQAAKA YAWMAL QEYAAMATE A’NNEE RAAZEYAN \nuntil I meet You on the Resurrection Day in such a state that You are pleased with me\nوَ عَنْ ذُ نُوْبِیْ غَاضِیًا،\nWA A’N ZONOOBEE GHAAZE-YAN \nhaving overlooked my sins\nقَدْ اَوْجَبْتَ لِیْ مِنْكَ الرَّحْمَةَ وَ الرِّضْوَانَ،\nQAD AWJABTA LEE MINKAR RAHMATA WAR-RIZWAANA \nand confer upon me with Your mercy and good pleasure\nوَ اَ نْزَلْتَنِیْ دَارَ الْقَرَارِ\nWA ANZALTANEE DAARAL QARAARE \nsettling me in the Eternal Abode \nوَ مَحَلَّ الْاَخْیَارِ .\nWA MAHALLAL AKHYAARE.\nand the Place of the Righteous."
}
